OL,3,GNEWSAAnger at plan to revamp museum's
OL,4,AVictorian street
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners have said they are
OL,7,F"appalled" by proposals to modernise a
OL,8,FVictorian street at a popular museum in
OL,9,FLeeds.
OL,11,FThe plans, announced last week, showed
OL,12,Fconcept art designed to make the Abbey
OL,13,FHouse Museum in Kirkstall more hands-on
OL,14,Fand immersive.
OL,16,FAngela Bamfort, who has been visiting
OL,17,Fthe museum since she was a child, said
OL,18,Fthe images - which appear to show an
OL,19,Fatrium, fairy lights and backless sofas
OL,20,F- were more like something she would
OL,21,Fexpect to see in a shopping mall.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
